Revision history for RT-Extension-ClockWidget

1.0.0  2026-04-26
  - Initial release
  - Animated flip-clock (HH:MM) with CSS 3D fold animation
  - Theme-aware widget background via Bootstrap CSS variables
  - German date line (Wochentag, Tag. Monat Jahr)
  - HTMX-safe: timer self-destructs when widget leaves the DOM
  - Compatible with RT 5.0+ / RT 6
